---
title: "State Diagram - Story"
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeVariables:
    background: '#ffffff'
    noteBkgColor: '#ffffff'
    noteBorderColor: '#999999'
    noteTextColor: '#000000'
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "DRAFT" as DRAFT
  state "GENERATING" as GENERATING
  state "READY" as READY

  [*] --> DRAFT : Parent creates story skeleton
  DRAFT --> GENERATING : Write with AI [length not custom, credit held]
  READY --> GENERATING : Rewrite with AI [no child has read it]
  GENERATING --> READY : AI result saved [credit consumed]
  GENERATING --> DRAFT : AI failed / blocked [credit released]
  DRAFT --> READY : Parent fills every page
  READY --> DRAFT : Page cleared
  DRAFT --> [*] : Delete story
  READY --> [*] : Delete story

  note right of GENERATING
    On AI failure the status is recomputed
    from pages: back to READY if every
    page already had text, else DRAFT
  end note

  note right of READY
    Stays READY when:
    - Parent reviews story with no gaps
      (reviewedAt set, narration queued)
  end note
